                        "form": "applis"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "4870b2d1-b0b3-41ab-bc42-0c3d401b6083",
                        "entry_id": "5bf9bc38-9c5a-3e82-b367-e3df19deb6c6",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "app"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ea53772d-7f76-34c2-b080-bddd7e17e20b",
                        "entry_id": "5bf9bc38-9c5a-3e82-b367-e3df19deb6c6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Application. Logiciel utilisé sur un ordinateur ou téléphone intelligent et ayant une fonction applicative."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "familiar"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "63ae9a3c-7dcf-4e55-a274-e5c9de9cf2fd",
                                "sense_id": "ea53772d-7f76-34c2-b080-bddd7e17e20b",
                                "text": "Apple est apparemment en train de changer la manière dont sont classées les applis, avec une pondération plus importante pour les avis des gens qui utilisent et qui aiment une appli."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "29dfba32-3f68-4732-b0eb-813d54198ae7",
                                "sense_id": "ea53772d-7f76-34c2-b080-bddd7e17e20b",
                                "text": "Nager, pédaler, écouter Bach, lire Manchette ou Deleuze, ne voir personne, avoir un jean et deux tee-shirts, habiter les appartements des autres, faire du yoga sur l’appli Downdog Yoga 8,99 euros par mois, guerrier pacifique, position de l’aigle, boire du Coca, manger des dattes, acheter des Malabar bleus à 20 centimes chez les rebeus, me raser la tête tous les huit jours au sabot 2."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "75cac5ce-eb64-4dd2-a97b-5f7cac4a2a46",
                                "sense_id": "ea53772d-7f76-34c2-b080-bddd7e17e20b",
                                "text": "Les confins les plus mystérieux du Web3 ne sont pas dans le métavers, mais sur l’appli de messagerie sombre et sifflotante qu’on appelle Discord."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3176d6e1-98c5-4a2a-a5ed-6f739473ce52",
                        "source_entry_id": "5bf9bc38-9c5a-3e82-b367-e3df19deb6c6",
                        "source_sense_id": "ea53772d-7f76-34c2-b080-bddd7e17e20b",
                        "target_lang_word": "app",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "app",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1bc72647-f6d6-32b1-af34-846e93a347d7",
                                        "entry_id": "fe8d6d39-22a5-37c6-addb-290a2db9e2ee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An application (program), especially a small one designed for a mobile device."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3afe710b-4954-454d-bf7e-8a2443be8eb5",
                                                "sense_id": "1bc72647-f6d6-32b1-af34-846e93a347d7",
                                                "text": "A visual tool can be thought of as a graphics app that generates most of your program's GUI code for you"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b485959a-cf75-4028-8b87-aa4d93e39bcc",
                                                "sense_id": "1bc72647-f6d6-32b1-af34-846e93a347d7",
                                                "text": "So is a spreadsheet app, but I'm not going to put those on a web site any time soon."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "668ffcd4-e905-42d8-b71c-021aa1409b6c",
                                                "sense_id": "1bc72647-f6d6-32b1-af34-846e93a347d7",
                                                "text": "The Web browser was the killer app that kickstarted the Internet and, in turn, enabled it to be embedded in everything"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "683455dd-c539-4e1f-a680-ed8c1eb08375",
                                                "sense_id": "1bc72647-f6d6-32b1-af34-846e93a347d7",
                                                "text": "Want realtime flight and gate updates? A calorie counter? A remote for your DVD player? Chances are there's an app for it. Smartphones separate themselves in another key area: connectivity"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e631016c-95b2-48ec-98a8-ffa475a70caf",
                                                "sense_id": "1bc72647-f6d6-32b1-af34-846e93a347d7",
                                                "text": "Parking is by app, which (when it works) is good. But £7.70 to park is extortionate, so GTR needs to look at reducing that."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6ce77741-f53d-34e2-9300-073871b62962",
                                        "entry_id": "fe8d6d39-22a5-37c6-addb-290a2db9e2ee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "application (use, purpose; not a computer program)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5048657-2947-4035-9615-11936e145580",
                                                "sense_id": "6ce77741-f53d-34e2-9300-073871b62962",
                                                "text": "SCULLY: What are these chips used for?\nPENDRELL: Video games, brake systems, they're finding new apps every day. I just read about one being designed to help the severely disabled operate computers using brainwaves."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "056568a9-90f4-332b-b7e6-f46d502f02af",
                                        "entry_id": "fe8d6d39-22a5-37c6-addb-290a2db9e2ee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "application (to a college etc.)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d89a853-ab57-479d-8de5-e7541969d6f5",
                                                "sense_id": "056568a9-90f4-332b-b7e6-f46d502f02af",
                                                "text": "“Ky—please don't take this the wrong way—I actually have to wear a dress from our line. You know, to show off my marketing materials on my college app. So, I'm working on it with Hannah.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "app",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9da40e10-d4a4-300a-a85c-a888f1971d5e",
                                        "entry_id": "f8764611-1bc2-3561-a801-6848655f9b17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "appetizer"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a74b17fc-908a-418c-84d1-5abb6acff500",
                                                "sense_id": "9da40e10-d4a4-300a-a85c-a888f1971d5e",
                                                "text": "The food is some of Breck's best: apps like sweet potato gnocchi with smoked chicken and sage cream[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a65e51b1-9f88-4a36-9828-c6a9a90aa1d5",
                                                "sense_id": "9da40e10-d4a4-300a-a85c-a888f1971d5e",
                                                "text": "If you lay out a platter of these exciting, beautiful vegetarian appetizers, the other apps will pale in comparison."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed5cf259-fd80-4089-9c34-606fab8f2954",
                                                "sense_id": "9da40e10-d4a4-300a-a85c-a888f1971d5e",
                                                "text": "This is not to say that we only serve apps at dinner parties. Quite the contrary; but for smaller gatherings, good appetizers can distinguish you as a host who puts more thought and effort into his or her party menu. Better yet, most apps are relatively easy to make[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "app",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3f8ca530-499a-34ea-a1af-2af720b0e7b2",
                                        "entry_id": "a4c658b9-b089-3ef5-8aac-cdcbe9121f30",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An appearance in a game."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
